      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":272.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"4016"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["name"],"member":{"name":"Find","parameterTypes":["System.String"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%name":{"$content":"PlayerHuman","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-1673.0,"y":692.0},"guid":"cc42bff5-edd5-4d98-92d7-20e7701ece54","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.InvokeMember","$id":"7560"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":902.0,"y":-240.0},"guid":"1d8d3a14-9787-4891-a4f3-bca3eb9021bc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"7564"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":175.0,"y":-634.0},"guid":"cde9b58b-2229-4177-9653-ea6f98be49c2","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"7566"},{"portType":"System.Object","SnapToGrid":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":1059.0},"guid":"83c1d405-2c26-477a-8a49-0a19292f760c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Community.ValueReroute","$id":"7568"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":753.0,"y":-176.0},"guid":"c2587110-a109-47c2-bbe0-79e2dfd5f26c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"7570"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":583.0,"y":271.0},"guid":"292374a0-066a-4322-ba68-cf3f455d1f68","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"7572"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":712.0,"y":-1088.0},"guid":"3e289a68-26d7-4246-ae12-867bb3c5e9bc","$version":